# Direct runtime dependencies of the mcp-ssh server.
#
# Transitive dependencies are resolved and hash-locked into
# requirements.txt by pip-compile. Regenerate with:
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --no-reuse-hashes requirements.in
#
# NOTE: run inside the python:3.13-alpine base image so the generated
# hashes match the wheels used at runtime. --no-reuse-hashes is required
# so hashes are collected for ALL platforms (including the sdist), not
# just the wheel selected on the regeneration host.

